<?xml version="1.0" encoding="utf-8"?>
<reference xml:id="enum.streamerrorcode" role="enum" xmlns="http://docbook.org/ns/docbook">
 <title>The StreamErrorCode Enum</title>
 <titleabbrev>StreamErrorCode</titleabbrev>

 <partintro>
  <section xml:id="enum.streamerrorcode.intro">
   &reftitle.intro;
   <simpara>
    The <enumname>StreamErrorCode</enumname> enum identifies the kind of
    error that a stream operation reported. It is available as
    <link linkend="streamerror.props.code">StreamError::$code</link>.
   </simpara>
   <simpara>
    The same case may be reported by different wrappers for different
    reasons; <link linkend="streamerror.props.message">StreamError::$message</link>
    describes the specific failure.
   </simpara>
  </section>

